---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  current="projects"
  title="东风何处是人间 / Where Does the East Wind Find the Earth?"
  description="以宋词统计阅读为题的中英双语交互项目，追随《东风何处是人间》的问题意识。"
>
  <article class="east-wind" lang="zh-Hans">
    <a class="back-link" href="/projects/">返回项目 / Back to projects</a>

    <header class="project-head">
      <p class="section-kicker">宋词统计读本 / Song Ci statistical reading</p>
      <h1>东风何处是人间<br />Where Does the East Wind Find the Earth?</h1>
      <p class="project-lede">
        这个项目从《全宋词》中反复出现的“东风”“何处”“人间”出发，重新组织为一个面向诗词读者的
        Hugging Face Space：语料检索、词频观察、自动词群、词语邻域和整首词的位置地图。
        <span>
          The project presents Song Ci statistics as a live, reader-facing Hugging Face Space.
        </span>
      </p>
      <p class="project-credit">
        灵感来自导师 Yixuan 的
        <a href="https://yixuan.blog/cn/2011/03/text-mining-of-song-poems/">《东风何处是人间》</a>。
        那篇文章以《全宋词》为对象，把“东风”“何处”“人间”推到问题的中心。
        <span>
          Inspired by Yixuan's 2011 essay on text mining Song Ci.
        </span>
      </p>
      <p class="project-actions">
        <a href="https://byleon-east-wind-songci.hf.space">打开独立 Space / Open Space</a>
        <a href="https://huggingface.co/spaces/BYLEON/east-wind-songci">查看 Space 仓库 / Space repository</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-section" aria-labelledby="space-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="section-kicker">交互应用 / interactive app</p>
        <h2 id="space-title">可以玩的宋词读本<br />A Playable Song Ci Reader</h2>
        <p>
          下面嵌入的是 Hugging Face Space。它读取完整的 <code>songci.csv</code> 和离线计算好的无监督统计结果，
          用交互图展示词频、词群、词语邻域和作品远近。
          <span>
            The embedded Space uses the corpus and saved unsupervised artifacts instead of frontend-only approximations.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-frame-wrap">
        <iframe
          src="https://byleon-east-wind-songci.hf.space"
          title="东风何处是人间 Hugging Face Space"
          loading="lazy"
          allow="clipboard-read; clipboard-write"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="scope-section" aria-labelledby="scope-title">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">范围 / scope</p>
        <h2 id="scope-title">只保留宋词主线<br />Song Ci Only</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        这个网页版本按当前项目要求去掉英国诗比较部分，保留并强化宋词语料的可读报告和交互入口。
        <span>
          The English poetry comparison is omitted; the web version focuses on the Song Ci corpus.
        </span>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .east-wind {
    --ink: #202124;
    --muted: #5f6368;
    --line: #d9dedb;
    --soft: #f6f7f5;
    --accent: #2f6f73;
    --accent-dark: #214f52;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px 64px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .back-link:hover,
  .project-credit a:hover,
  .project-actions a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .project-head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 30px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .section-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  code {
    font-size: 0.95em;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 980px;
    font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.65rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .project-lede,
  .project-credit,
  .section-head p,
  .scope-section p {
    max-width: 900px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.78;
  }

  .project-lede span,
  .project-credit span,
  .section-head span,
  .scope-section span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    color: #747a7d;
  }

  .project-credit a {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .project-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .project-actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .project-actions a:first-child {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .space-section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 34px 0;
  }

  .section-head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .space-frame-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 780px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--soft);
  }

  .space-frame-wrap iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: min(92vh, 900px);
    min-height: 780px;
    border: 0;
  }

  .scope-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 0.34fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .east-wind {
      padding: 28px 16px 48px;
    }

    .project-actions a {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .space-frame-wrap,
    .space-frame-wrap iframe {
      min-height: 680px;
    }

    .scope-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
